# Constrained mutation rejects an incompatible subtype

Verifies assigning a kilogram value to an `int<mm>[]` element is rejected
because no conversion between the measure dimensions exists.

>>> source
let sizes: int<mm>[] = [10mm]
sizes[0] = 5kg

<<< stdout

<<< stderr
eck: conversion from `kilogram` to subtype `millimeter` is not defined at Span { start: 41, end: 44 }

<<< exit
1
